  "notes": [
    "The fixed-resolution option ports the 100% render-scale behavior from the Switch Lite test. Actual docked and handheld pixel dimensions need verification.",
    "The 4K and ultrawide configuration PAKs are byte-identical to v1.43. Compatibility and profile loading need a v2.00 runtime check.",
    "The ultrawide port uses the active HUD and aspect writes. The unreferenced helper and its unused constant write were omitted.",
    "The optional dynamic-resolution patch changes two frame budget setters to 16 ms and leaves dynamic mode and its scaling limits to the game. It is a standalone alternative to fixed resolution.",
    "LOD uses a unique matching call context. Visual effect unverified in v2.00."
  ],
  "runtime_test_report": "Eden testing reported by M-Essa11. Individual option results and measured render dimensions were not supplied."
